    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market this superb home with huge scope to extend in the ever popular and much sought after pocket of Firhouse, No. 13 Killakee Lawns. The bright and spacious accommodation includes an entrance hallway, living room, open plan kitchen and dining room while upstairs there are 3 generous sized bedrooms and a family bathroom. Outside to the rear you will find a large rear garden which is not overlooked and is the ideal setting for entertaining guests or enjoying a family BBQ. To the front of the property there is concrete / driveway providing off street parking for multiple cars. \n\nKillakee will enjoy easy & immediate access to every amenity including shops, restaurants, cafes, public houses, libraries and many sporting & recreation facilities along with an impressive choice of schools. Enviably positioned at the foot of the Dublin Mountains, just 25 minutes' drive from the City Centre & with Dublin's main motorway network less than a 5 minute drive away, it makes all of Dublin easily accessible.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
